    QuestResponseMapper ..> QuestRun : map detail
    QuestNpcAssignmentService ..> IQuestNpcTemplateRepository : use
    QuestNpcAssignmentService ..> QuestNpcTemplate : selects
    QuestAllyNpcActionPolicy ..> QuestRun : use
    QuestAllyNpcActionPolicy ..> QuestParticipantId : use
    QuestAllyNpcActionPolicy ..> Move : use
    QuestSnapshotFactory ..> QuestRunPartyMemberSnapshot : builds
    QuestSnapshotFactory ..> EquipmentStatusResolver : use
    QuestSnapshotFactory ..> PlayerEquipment : use
    QuestSnapshotFactory ..> Equipment : use
    QuestRunFactory ..> IQuestEnemyDefinitionRepository : use
    QuestRunFactory ..> QuestRun : builds
    QuestBattleFactory ..> QuestAllyNpcActionPolicy : use
    QuestBattleFactory ..> IMoveRepository : use
    QuestBattleFactory ..> QuestSubmittedCommand : use
    QuestRunOutcomeJudge ..> QuestRunResolutionSummary : returns
    QuestRunService ..> QuestRun : use
    QuestRunService ..> IQuestRunRepository : use
    QuestRunService ..> QuestStageRewardLotteryService : use
    QuestRunService ..> IPlayerEquipmentRepository : use
    QuestRunService ..> QuestRewardEquipmentGrant : builds
